"string"],"description":"Service id or exact name (see list_services). Defaults to the service selected in the wizard."},"provider_id":{"type":["integer","string"],"description":"Provider id or full name. Defaults to the wizard selection or the only provider of the service."},"date":{"type":"string","description":"First day to check, "YYYY-MM-DD". Defaults to today."},"days":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of consecutive days to check (1-7, default 1)."}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"id":"book_appointment","description":"CREATES a real appointment at this business as soon as it is called — do not call until the user has confirmed service, time and contact details. Requires an open slot from check_availability ("date" + business-local "time"). On success the visible wizard reflects the selection, the page navigates to the booking confirmation screen, and the response includes the appointment id plus the personal manage/cancel link (which the site also emails to the customer when email notifications are enabled). If the slot was just taken, the response lists the remaining open slots.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"service_id":{"type":["integer","string"],"description":"Service id or exact name (see list_services)."},"provider_id":{"type":["integer","string"],"description":"Provider id or full name. Defaults to the only/selected provider of the service."},"date":{"type":"string","description":"Appointment day, "YYYY-MM-DD"."},"time":{"type":"string","description":"Start time from check_availability, business-local 24h "HH:mm"."},"first_name":{"type":"string","description":"Customer first name."},"last_name":{"type":"string","description":"Customer last name."},"email":{"type":"string","description":"Customer email — receives the confirmation and manage link."},"phone_number":{"type":"string","description":"Customer phone number."},"address":{"type":"string","description":"Customer street address."},"city":{"type":"string","description":"Customer city."},"zip_code":{"type":"string","description":"Customer zip code."},"notes":{"type":"string","description":"Optional notes for the business."}},"required":["date","time","first_name","last_name","email","phone_number"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"id":"cancel_appointment","description":"PERMANENTLY cancels an existing appointment as soon as it is called — only call after the user explicitly confirms. Requires the appointment_reference token from the customer's confirmation email (the site's own manage-link key); it cannot be guessed or looked up by email address. The appointment is first verified; if it exists and is still cancellable it is cancelled and the site's own cancellation confirmation screen is shown. The outcome is awaited, so a failed request is reported as a failure and nothing is changed. Cancellation is not reversible.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"reason":{"type":"string","description":"Cancellation reason to record for the business (required by the site)."},"appointment_reference":{"type":"string","description":"The appointment reference from the confirmation email/manage link (the token after "booking/reschedule/")."}},"required":["reason","appointment_reference"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"id":"__finish__","description":"The task is complete. Report an answer supported by the observations.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":3900}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"id":"__abstain__","description":"Stop because the task cannot be completed with the available actions or evidence.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false}}],"observation":{"tools":["ask_site","list_services","sign_in","check_availability","book_appointment","cancel_appointment"]},"history":[{"tool":"list_services","input":{},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{
